id: VER13-4
package: fandhe-workshop-web
test: ir_refusal_host
features: test-hooks
target: crates/web/src/host.rs
find:         host.ir_refusal = Some(err.reason_code());
replace:         host.ir_refusal = Some(err.reason_code()).filter(|_| false);
expect-fail: refused_host_shows_the_notice_with_the_code_only
note: 起動で断ったホストが理由コードを控えない（通知が出ず、教材も無い空の画面になる）
